        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Dharmatma\n- People: Ratan Khatri\n- Places: Afghanistan\n- Concepts: Matka, satta, New York Cotton Exchange\n\nFacts:\n- Dharmatma is a 1975 Hindi thriller movie.\n- Dharmatma was the first Bollywood film to be shot in Afghanistan.\n- The title character of Dharmatma was based on Ratan Khatri, who was known as the matka king.\n- Matka, also called satta, is a form of lottery.\n- Matka originally involved betting on the opening and closing cotton rates transmitted from the New York Cotton Exchange.",
